@IdeaFactory.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000

### Health Check
GET {{IdeaFactory.Api_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Alive Check
GET {{IdeaFactory.Api_HostAddress}}/alive
Accept: application/json

### Today's View (clean prompt - should pass)
POST {{IdeaFactory.Api_HostAddress}}/api/insight/today
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ticker": "RELIANCE"
}

### Investment Brief (clean prompt - should pass)
POST {{IdeaFactory.Api_HostAddress}}/api/insight/brief
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ticker": "TCS"
}

### Explain Movement (clean prompt - should pass)
POST {{IdeaFactory.Api_HostAddress}}/api/insight/explain
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ticker": "HDFC",
  "context": "Volume spiked 3x average with 5% price drop"
}

### Forbidden Term Test (should return 422)
POST {{IdeaFactory.Api_HostAddress}}/api/insight/today
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ticker": "RELIANCE",
  "context": "Should I buy RELIANCE?"
}

### Governance Report
GET {{IdeaFactory.Api_HostAddress}}/api/governance/report?days=7
Accept: application/json

### Audit Records
GET {{IdeaFactory.Api_HostAddress}}/api/governance/audits?days=1
Accept: application/json
